## Swap using call by value

------------------------------------------
#include <stdio.h>

void swap(int a, int b) {          /* a, b are copies */
    int t = a;
    a = b;
    b = t;
    printf("Inside swap: a = %d, b = %d\n", a, b);
}

int main(void) {
    int x = 10, y = 20;
    printf("Before swap: x = %d, y = %d\n", x, y);
    swap(x, y);                    /* call by value */
    printf("After swap:  x = %d, y = %d\n", x, y);
    return 0;
}
------------------------------------------

## Output

------------------------------------------
Before swap: x = 10, y = 20
Inside swap: a = 20, b = 10
After swap:  x = 10, y = 20
------------------------------------------

• Inside swap the copies a and b are exchanged (20, 10), but x and y in main are **not changed** (10, 20), because only copies were passed.
• To change x and y themselves, pass their addresses: swap(&x, &y) with void swap(int *p, int *q).

Exam tip: show all three output lines; the 'after' line is the point of the question.

answer.bn:
## Call by value দিয়ে swap

------------------------------------------
#include <stdio.h>

void swap(int a, int b) {          /* a, b are copies */
    int t = a;
    a = b;
    b = t;
    printf("Inside swap: a = %d, b = %d\n", a, b);
}

int main(void) {
    int x = 10, y = 20;
    printf("Before swap: x = %d, y = %d\n", x, y);
    swap(x, y);                    /* call by value */
    printf("After swap:  x = %d, y = %d\n", x, y);
    return 0;
}
------------------------------------------

## Output

------------------------------------------
Before swap: x = 10, y = 20
Inside swap: a = 20, b = 10
After swap:  x = 10, y = 20
------------------------------------------

• swap-এর ভেতরে copy a ও b অদলবদল হয় (20, 10), কিন্তু main-এর x ও y **বদলায় না** (10, 20), কারণ শুধু copy পাঠানো হয়েছিল।
• x ও y নিজেদের বদলাতে তাদের address পাঠান: void swap(int *p, int *q) দিয়ে swap(&x, &y)।

